# ─── Build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
*.js.map
*.tsbuildinfo
*.bak
*.tgz
nohup.out

# ─── OS / editor noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store

# ─── Local databases (NEVER ship) ────────────────────────────────────────────
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ─── Internal handoff / agent instructions (project-private) ─────────────────
HANDOFF.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# ─── Marketing / draft content (NEVER ship) ─────────────────────────────────
# Dev.to drafts, Show HN copy, social posts, slide decks — author-only artifacts
GROWTH.md
implementar.md

# ─── OC + CC coordination (inter-tool orchestration artifacts) ────────────────
workflow.json
.orchestrate-metrics.json
.ai-collab/
.opencode/
.engram/
.claude/

# ─── SDD specs (local-only design records) ──────────────────────────────────
specs/

# ─── Doc storage — whitelist approach ────────────────────────────────────────
# Marketing / OC-CC artifacts in docs/ — never ship (explicit re-ignore)
docs/devto-*.md
docs/*-article-*.md
docs/SPEC-*.md
docs/roast-*.md
docs/share-*.md
docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md
docs/cloudinary-*.md

# Everything else in docs/ ignored — versioned docs are whitelisted below.
# NOTE: use `docs/*` (NOT `docs/`) so individual files can be re-included.
docs/*
*.md
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!ROADMAP.md
!docs/LIBRARY.md
!docs/COMMANDS.md
!docs/CONFIG.md
!docs/DASHBOARD.md
!docs/MCP.md